</Field Guns Equipment>

<overview>
<p>The Draconis Combine Mustered Soldiery assigns conventional infantry to garrison roles across its military districts, with district regulars often fielding extra platoons to secure worlds that BattleMech forces cannot permanently garrison. Wheeled mechanized infantry ride armored personnel carriers that offer speed on roads and enough protection to survive initial contact. The DCMS assigns these platoons where garrison duty demands both rapid response and the ability to dismount under fire, a combination that foot and motorized troops cannot reliably deliver. Equipped with laser rifles that outrange and outpenetrate ballistic weapons at every engagement distance. The cost is significant: laser rifles are expensive to procure, and each soldier must carry additional power packs that add weight and logistical burden. Where the budget allows, they are worth every C-bill. These Xenoplanetary Condition Troops carry specialized survival gear for hostile environments that would kill standard infantry: extreme temperatures, toxic atmospheres, crushing gravity. Where other troops cannot operate, XCT platoons fight as though conditions were normal.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on prototype date of Magna laser rifle. Magna laser rifle is standard DCMS laser weapon.
</notes>

